<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">Titus</book>
  <para style="h">Titus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Titus</para>
  <para style="toc2">Titus</para>
  <para style="mt">Titus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian ii naseampa le Jesus Christ ii sawltakpa, keima Paul in lai kong thaak hi. Kei masia Pathian teal sate upna khantosak natu le, ih biakna ii hil thumaan thutak ah, a lampui tu in hong kiteal a, hong kipuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua thumaan thutak sia tawntung nuntakna lametna tungah kiphut hi. A leilot ngawl Pathian in hi nuntakna sia, ei atu in, hun kipat pan ma hong kamciam zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuaciang a hun hong tun tak ciangin, ama ii hong puak thu sungah hong pualaak hi. Hi thu sia kei hong ki aap a, tuaciang ih Ngumpa Pathian hong thupiakna taw ka thangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ih nei khop tek upna sungah ka tapa tatak ahi Titus tungah lai kong at hi. Pathian le ih Hunpa Christ Jesus in, thuthiamna le thinnopna hong pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sep tu a kitaangsamh lai teng, ahi tu bangin a vaihawmsak tu le khuapi simin pawlpi upate na koi thei natu in, Crete ah nang hong nusia ka hi hi. Kong vaithakte na phawk tan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />pawlpi upa khat sia sitbaang ngawl tu hi; ama in zi khat bek a nei hi tu a, tuaciang, a tate sia thu um mi hi tu hi, a uuk po ngamtate le thu ni ngawlin a minthangte hi ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pawlpi lampui khat sia Pathian ii nasepna a uk ahikom, ama sia paubanna nei ngawl tu hi. A ma sia a kihisak, a thintom, zukham thei, a ngoltol, ahibuale sum lamsang a duhop hi ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in zindo thiam tu a, a phate dei tu hi. Ama le ama ki uk zo tu a, thutangin, thiangtho in, phinciing tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in up tu thubul taw a kisi, a muan thamman thu sia kho takin len tu hi. Tuabang hile thumaan hilcianna taw ngualdangte hanthawn thei tu a, tuaciang, tua thumaan kihilna a nalhte ii khialna zongh lak thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, tuabang mihing tam mama om a, a tuanin Jew biakna sung pan hong kikhealte in, amate ii thu nawnsante taw ngual langpanin theam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maizum maw in sum nga nopna bek taw, a kilawm ngawl thute a hilna uh taw, innkuan bubup buaisak ahikom, a thuson ih khaktan kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate ii kamsaang khat ahi thumaan a son Crete mipui khat ma in, “Crete mite sia a leilot tawntungte, ngamsa ngilote le a datham antuangte hi,” ci hi. Hi thu hu in, amate nasia takin teih lete amate in a maan upna nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang Jew te ii phuatawm taanghthute le thumaan thutak a nial mihingte ii thupiakte amate in len nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thinsung thiangtho mihingte atu in, na theampo thiangtho hi; ahihang a ninnoite le a um ngawlte atu in, bangma a thiangtho om ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile amate thinsung le a khua ngaisutnate ninnoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in Pathian ka he uh ci ahihang, amate ngamtatnate taw kileebul hi. Amate sia ki etsatna taw kidim a, thu ni ngawl ahiciang a pha khat zongh seam tu in kiphu ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahihang nang na hile, upna thubul maan taw a kisi thute na hil kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasal khanghaamzawte sia a kilawm bang ngamtatna nei tu, khuangaisun thei tu, amate le amate ki uk zo tu; a upna uh maan tu, ki itna nei tu, tuaciang thuak zawkna a nei natu uh in na hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuasia bangma, numei khanghaamzawte a thiangtho nuntakna taw a nungta numeite bangin, a ngamtat natu hil in. Amate sia ngual ngensia theite hi ngawl tu a, sapittui ii sila hi ngawl tu hi. Amate in a pha teng hil thei tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />amate sungah numei khangmoizawte in a pasal uh le a tate uh a it natu in hil tu uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />amate le amate a ki uk zo, a thiangtho, tuaciang a pasalte ii thu a ni, bangkua nupi pha ahi thei tu in hil tu nu hi, tua hile Pathian kung pan hong pai thute, kuama in sonsia ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuabang ma in pa khangmoite sia, amate le amate ki uk zawk natu in hanthawn ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na theampo ah ngamtat phatna taw kisai in nangma mama a ettee taak na hi kul tu hi. Na hilna sungah deisak takpina le thupi laakna taw hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sit thei tu ahi ngawl kammal kilawmte zangh in, tua hile na ngalte in, ei huvau a sia hong pau natu, a heak ngawl uh ciangin, amate maizum thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sila te in na theampo sungah, a tote thu zawp tu a, amate lungkimsak tu hi. Amate kam zo kik ngawl tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a neisa nguksak ngawl tu hi. Tua hi zaw ngawlin, silate in, a tawntung a uphuai le mihing pha ahi hunlam a lak kul tu hi, tua hile ih Ngumpa Pathian thu kihilna sia a sepna theampo ah man neisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian in mihing theampo ngupna nga natu in, a thuthiamna hong pualaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua thu thiamna in, eite Pathian dei ngawl nuntakna zia, leitung taw kisai lungngul nate nusia in hong sawl a, hi leitung ah eima le eima a ki uk zo nuntakna, thutang le Pathian dei bang nuntaknate taw ih nuntak tu in hong hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A lian ih Pathian le Hunpa Jesus Christ minthanna taw hong kilangh tu ih lam et thupha hong tun Ni ngak in, ih om laitak tuabangin ngamta tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Seksolna theampo pan ih suatak natu le ama bek ii neisa hi in, a pha sep tu a lawp, a thiangtho mite hong suasak natu in ama le ama sia ei atu hong kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na thu hong ngaite, na hanthot ciang le na hil na pau ciangin nangma thuneina theampo na zangh in a, hi thute na hil ta'n. Amate kuama in nangma nomusak heak in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngamukte le thuneite thu zawpin a thu a nit natu le thupha theampo vawt tu in a kingin khol natu na mihingte na phawksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kuama siat son ngawlin, ngual taw kilem a, a kuama theampo tungah, cikna thiamna a lak tawntung natu na son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, eima zongh khatvei lai in, a mawmaw, thu ni ngawl le a khial thei mi ih hi ngei hi. Ci le sa deina le nopsakna namcin ii sila ih hi ngei hi. Ih nuntakna sia hazatna le eenna taw ih zangh hi; ngual in hong ensan a, tuaciang ei zongh in ih ensan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang ih Ngumpa Pathian ii cikna le itna hong pualaak ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ama in ei hong ngum hi. Tua in eite ii naphate ih sep hang hi ngawl a, pianthakna le nuntakna thak hong pia Thaa Thiangtho tungtawnin, ama hong hesuakna taw hong ngup ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian in Jesus Christ ih Hunpa tungtawnin, Thaa Thiangtho sia a kicing takin, eite tungah hong buak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuasia ciangin ama ii thuthiamna taw, eite sia Pathian taw thutang suak thei in ih lamet ahi tawntung nuntakna hong neisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hisia in a maan thu sonna ahi hi. Pathian umte in mihing khat sim atu thinbot thei a, a manphate sep natu in a hun uh a piak thei natu in hi thute na thupi laak tuam tu in ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang a mawmawthuai kam kinial nate, taanghpupite khang simna saute, kihauna le thukham huvau khat le khat kinialna te na pial tavun. Tuate sia phattuamna om ngawl a, man nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawl kikhenna a piangsak mihing khat ii tungah a kidop thei natu, niivei peuma na hil tavun, tua zawkciang ahile, ama taw na kipee nawn heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabang mihingte sia a lal hi a, a mawnate in ama a khial hunlam kilanghsak ahi sia na he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Artemas ahibuale Tychicus sia nang kungah kong puak ciang, kei kung Nicopolis ah nong pai natu in hong hanciam ta'n, banghang ziam cile, phalbi hun sia tua munah zak tu in ka khensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sitnipa Zenas le Apollos khualhaw hong kipat thei natu in na hu in a, a kisap tu theampo ahithei za in na vaihawmsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kitaangsamh tatak teng a piak thei natu in mihingte in a hun uh sia thupha vawtna in a zak thei natu a sin uh kul tu hi; amate in a nuntak nate man nei ngawlin zangh heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka ompui theampo in, hong paupui tek uh hi. Upna sungah ih lawmte theampo tungah nuksetna kam na sonsak in. Pathian ii thuthiamna sia note theampo taw hong om tahen.
  </para>
</usx>
